PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-C-DAY LK-T-DAY LK-FINAL-BOWLS LK-ORDER46 LK-STATUS.
MAIN.
    MOVE 0 TO LK-STATUS WS-STATUS
    SET WS-ZERO-HEAD WS-ZERO-TAIL TO NULL
    PERFORM LOAD-TABLES
    PERFORM BUILD-COUNTS
    IF LK-STATUS NOT = 0 GOBACK END-IF
    PERFORM BUILD-STONES
    IF LK-STATUS NOT = 0 GOBACK END-IF
    PERFORM BUILD-HIDDEN
    IF LK-STATUS NOT = 0 GOBACK END-IF
    PERFORM BUILD-VISIBLE
    IF LK-STATUS NOT = 0 GOBACK END-IF
    PERFORM BUILD-INITIAL-BOWLS
    IF LK-STATUS NOT = 0 GOBACK END-IF
    PERFORM APPLY-DROPS-TO-BOWLS
    IF LK-STATUS NOT = 0 GOBACK END-IF
    PERFORM POST-STIR-12
    IF LK-STATUS NOT = 0 GOBACK END-IF
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 6
        MOVE WS-BOWL(WS-I) TO LK-FINAL-BOWL(WS-I)
        MOVE WS-ORDER46-ID(WS-I) TO LK-ORDER46-ID(WS-I)
    END-PERFORM
    GOBACK.

